        "era": "traditional",
        "reason": "This is a songket-style selendang (shoulder cloth) with a gold-thread floral field and red border with pucuk rebung (bamboo-shoot) motifs, a textile tradition shared across the Malay world including Palembang and Malaysia; such cloths cannot be reliably distinguished between neighboring Malay groups."
